    <string name="m_tip_body">• Profiles: one tap = settings + start\n• Caption: pinch = text size, long press = save favourite\n• Transcripts: search, speakers, editing, DOCX/PDF export\n• Settings: light/dark theme, audio saving, vocabulary learning</string>
