    <string name="m_wizard_title">First-time setup</string>
    <string name="m_wizard_sub">A few steps, then it starts with one tap.</string>
    <string name="m_step1">1. Download models</string>
    <string name="m_step1_desc">Recognizer (%1$s) and translation model. One-time download (about 100–200 MB) – internet required, Wi-Fi recommended.</string>
    <string name="m_step2">2. Display over other apps</string>
    <string name="m_step2_desc">Without this the caption cannot appear over the video.</string>
    <string name="m_step3">3. Microphone and notifications</string>
    <string name="m_step3_desc">Needed for speech recognition (capturing internal audio asks for its own permission on start).</string>
    <string name="m_step4">4. Turn off battery optimisation (recommended)</string>
    <string name="m_step4_desc">Otherwise the system may stop the app in the background after a few minutes. Turn it off for this app and allow auto-start too.</string>
